Source: https://github.com/thunderbird/thunderbird-desktop/commit/bee0fb09bf1715e0066d40c80f5600e606bd24f2

Coverage: Actual diff inspected; related inverse/reland duplicate hunks checked as a chain.
Full four-file diff. Cross-folder threaded/grouped rebuild bypassed normal Sort metadata update. UpdateSortInfo plus explicit SaveSortInfo before RebuildView preserve prior primary as secondary; helper intentionally leaves primary fields to caller. Test verifies all four fields before and after refresh. Review kept save boundary explicit, simplified behavioral comments, removed incidental console.log, and requested braces on touched conditions.

